Subject: [PATCH] feat(bedrock): render static persona mesh geometry

Render self-contained Character Creator geometry through the Bedrock player model when all six body parts are present. Unsupported animated and split-face layouts retain a visible vanilla fallback rather than installing a blank renderer.
